<h1 local-id=3D"c8829d3c94ac" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-SKU&amp;PriceGovernanceandSystem-of-RecordPlan">SKU &amp; Pric=
e Governance and System-of-Record Plan</h1>
<p local-id=3D"09964c230b52"><strong>Salesforce Revenue Cloud Advanced (Sou=
rce of Truth) =E2=86=92 Workday (Financial System of Record)</strong><br><s=
trong>Document Owner:</strong> Business Systems &amp; Innovation<br><strong=
>Last Updated:</strong> <em>(3/6/2026)</em><br><strong>Audience:</strong> R=
evOps, Sales Ops, Finance, Accounting, BSI Integration, Product, Order Mana=
gement, Billing</p>
<hr local-id=3D"d6fda38e-86f2-4fb0-98de-53f0ec7a3d20">
<h2 local-id=3D"d16b619fd1aa" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-1)Purpose">1) Purpose</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f1df4d7ae8dd">This document defines the enterprise approach =
for managing <strong>SKU (Product) master data and price lists</strong> whi=
le supporting the end-to-end process:</p>
<blockquote local-id=3D"1526567c-0926-44c3-b06f-005784670b6b">
<p local-id=3D"40905bb7cdba"><strong>Quote (Salesforce) =E2=86=92 Order (Sa=
lesforce) =E2=86=92 Contract (Salesforce) -&gt;Contract (Workday) =E2=86=92=
 Invoice (Workday)</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p local-id=3D"f298c4f03353">Because quoting and invoicing occur in differe=
nt systems, we must ensure:</p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"3f7651e0-ef9e-4e1b-83e8-258cd5ca946a">
<li local-id=3D"7e54015d-862b-4181-82c6-77b85b41bac7">
<p local-id=3D"6dc25cfe9c06"><strong>One single source of truth for SKU and=
 official price list data</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c527c7e3-46f6-4fce-a192-d2b6cad091b3">
<p local-id=3D"0107c576e302">Ability to <strong>export an official price li=
st</strong> at any time (audit, customer, internal use)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fa1cb8bf-24b7-4fcc-94b8-c469f5bf94fc">
<p local-id=3D"f271d7ac6321"><strong>Consistency between Salesforce and Wor=
kday</strong> to prevent invoice errors, revenue leakage, and reconciliatio=
n efforts</p></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"d7f85ad7-cae8-4516-bcb8-95826ad83b46">
<h2 local-id=3D"627a9c8aa34c" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-2)ExecutiveSummary/Decision">2) Executive Summary / Decision</=
h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"b02417ce08b5" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Decision">Decision</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c793d9c2-6a14-4f7c-a741-3e61acdcb1c0">
<li local-id=3D"55149680-44c2-4374-b2d9-3bea0d1299fb">
<p local-id=3D"e578ee33cea6"><strong>Salesforce Revenue Cloud Advanced (RCA=
) is the System of Truth for SKU and Price Lists</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3cd5ec50-824c-4f83-9172-27333efce1b2">
<p local-id=3D"73f30eb62d8d"><strong>Workday is the Financial System of Rec=
ord for Contracts and Invoices</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f974166b-1363-4325-947d-913562c75205">
<p local-id=3D"9c45589161d4">SKU and price master data will be <strong>main=
tained in Salesforce</strong> and <strong>pushed downstream to Workday</str=
ong> via an integration layer (MuleSoft).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"586760a7-84ff-4ca2-9dc5-f6e44c52edfe">
<p local-id=3D"1feeb858525b"><strong>No manual creation or editing of SKUs =
in Workday</strong> (except integration-admin controlled mapping fields if =
required).</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"6c7488e61f61" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-GuidingPrinciples">Guiding Principles</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"efcc49b3-bf94-4a21-9b07-0768c2a23567">
<li local-id=3D"ca0c0989-0772-44cd-afdd-d32bfea4fbf3">
<p local-id=3D"9c71a5075d91"><strong>One-way sync for master data:</strong>=
 Salesforce =E2=86=92 Workday</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a49868ef-67b5-4c99-a922-fd3555c2ccd1">
<p local-id=3D"d48feb0e50ce"><strong>Event-driven sync for transactions:</s=
trong> Orders/Amendments from Salesforce =E2=86=92 Workday</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e265d097-e11e-4b24-98d7-68bd972ad35a">
<p local-id=3D"ce2d10e6077e"><strong>Immutable SKU Code:</strong> once crea=
ted, the SKU identifier never changes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8d02a4c5-d588-41e8-81a6-5bca1ffca3af">
<p local-id=3D"47e63133b7d6"><strong>Effective dating:</strong> pricing and=
 key commercial attributes are versioned over time (no overwrites)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"8fd6b803-1ab7-490d-a7e9-4042153db005">
<h2 local-id=3D"89217f675704" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-3)WhySalesforceOwnsSKU&amp;Price(Rationale)">3) Why Salesforce=
 Owns SKU &amp; Price (Rationale)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"d348fae490cb">Salesforce must own SKU and pricing master dat=
a because:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d2a25376-a51f-4393-bab3-274fdefccb4b">
<li local-id=3D"cf8ff47c-b618-453c-9496-4b7d878426a5">
<p local-id=3D"f0978d434ec6">Salesforce RCA is the system that <strong>crea=
tes quotes and orders</strong>, and therefore must <strong>model products, =
bundles, and commercial pricing</strong> accurately.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"55bde4e9-ad0a-40b4-9592-5e8da5e584c1">
<p local-id=3D"a6ce34314862">Workday is optimized for <strong>financial exe=
cution</strong>: contracts, invoicing, accounting controls, and revenue rec=
ognition=E2=80=94not commercial configuration and pricing logic.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6bed1582-c1e3-4c0f-b517-ad316ae4cf9f">
<p local-id=3D"edf5164d08e7">A single authoritative SKU + price list source=
 avoids:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3972b18c-f59b-45d0-a17f-6a681ae5599f">
<li local-id=3D"9c846f17-8890-4f36-8186-b615dfccad1d">
<p local-id=3D"cef7ebda34c4">duplicate SKU definitions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fcf03e20-1e75-4836-af82-9c4482bc0480">
<p local-id=3D"110e79bfc7ca">mismatched pricing between quote and invoice</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e6e527b4-4ab1-41a2-b467-3276bdec5e2c">
<p local-id=3D"5c93cff935f9">manual reconciliation and audit risk</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"6ccb59e2-f7ce-4836-b9dd-6021127aadf8">
<h2 local-id=3D"25b9e99f6ba0" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-4)SystemsofRecordvsSystemsofUse">4) Systems of Record vs Syste=
ms of Use</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"0ec1398a-c683-4683-9794-b51=
e870420a3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"48be155c-76e3-499e-8212-ba98afb65745">
<th data-local-id=3D"a93b3b6b-1a9b-4f08-8a13-65da825700ca" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"5902d52b1044">Data Domain</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"4ac2ca83-3792-4777-9ebf-c6a94f033baa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"bb2d33fdb9cc">Primary System (Source of Truth)</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"2180fa76-6024-4d66-bc0d-1cf891211524" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"f1b1b4b8a700">Secondary System</p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"d9b723c1-e647-4528-b13e-3fef6b4a0a6e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"d19761ff8720">Notes</p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"58233b18-8a25-4173-8cac-8c174e5e1304">
<td data-local-id=3D"9b1f5194-25c6-425d-b8ed-3d2b6ddf25f6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"88d02fe6fef0">SKU / Product Master (commercial definition)</=
p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ed8cd235-fa6b-43da-836e-688957bb30bf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9351eee4b812"><strong>Salesforce RCA</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b9ca1fce-704c-4d3a-863f-3050996c231c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0eb52be22324">Workday (mirror)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c1f39003-a6ce-4113-b2ad-b694f538cb26" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"49af78dee768">Workday stores a synchronized subset for billi=
ng/contract reference</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7afa7005-32e4-4690-b652-1ddd66c330f2">
<td data-local-id=3D"72d2cd93-dd95-4daa-9202-b93c9c797226" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"faaf6e5af4f8">Official Price Lists (published)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6d04f433-6aef-4cef-a63e-fbb69a969176" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d90d0ff7ed0f"><strong>Salesforce RCA</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"af914dfc-6143-465d-b248-ab8f77e3d77e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"92692163c2c8">Workday (reference optional)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"df363032-334e-4858-8c9c-24e429c6b64b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a018943517fc">Workday should invoice based on order line amo=
unts, not re-price</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9e7392c5-1250-4f8e-89d8-6152c53e6742">
<td data-local-id=3D"a18c5509-9fcd-4334-85e6-b788c466e836" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"567dbe612fd1">Quotes, Orders, Amendments</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"833a7b93-df4d-49c7-bb77-4162d65ba285" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f8252fb62f89"><strong>Salesforce RCA</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a6dfc0be-fa57-4416-bf2c-317678ae8150" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2c8a7c4bba17">Workday (consumes)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c9c85928-b8b9-4f74-b41d-f2d296e808ba" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"72de684e8d6b">Orders/amendments are the transactional handof=
f</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b98dc755-d0db-4cfb-b66a-8c317ed16c31">
<td data-local-id=3D"3988d657-0697-4551-99c3-7dbb5d68dbad" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b5122d3e290">Contracts &amp; Invoices</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"33540b86-698a-4f53-8e76-752fae789cc8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"213d60d0e677">Workday</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4069e2e8-cc60-4937-9504-41d0c993463a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"704045bfeb1b">Salesforce (status visibility)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"549e9305-97ab-4d85-a59f-e24e90aa82f4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"30e05bf571bf">Workday owns financial documents and invoice l=
ifecycle</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
