</div>
<hr local-id=3D"9874c3d2-7276-4c92-bdc2-dd2b3ef7fb0d">
<h2 local-id=3D"c28d7c82942b" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-5)DataOwnership&amp;EditingRules">5) Data Ownership &amp; Edit=
ing Rules</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"b45dd569ceb1" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Ownership(whochangeswhat)">Ownership (who changes what)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"6f6d9bf8-f23d-41fc-a6c6-3a6dd79f97da">
<li local-id=3D"b6e10108-5853-47b9-8912-8635c5bf4a1e">
<p local-id=3D"62ddeea3085d"><strong>RevOps / Product Ops</strong> owns:</p=
>
<ul local-id=3D"c0dacb72-630c-4f22-8586-6a9827d2bd91">
<li local-id=3D"94443aa3-b8dc-453a-a43e-b080410c4023">
<p local-id=3D"e0daa7b7c5d8">SKU creation/retirement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"77bce43e-ff8e-4f85-8bba-33a078cd9efe">
<p local-id=3D"67d4e67522e0">product naming/descriptions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6efb079b-8390-4932-9ef0-db61310da8b3">
<p local-id=3D"0b5c77e096e5">packaging/offer structure (bundles)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"12a78054-bea0-400f-bba5-e8003e7be222">
<p local-id=3D"07e0bcd4d99f">price list maintenance (list price + effective=
 dates)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"d0ebb334-bc53-4f6b-bcae-05d959c77472">
<p local-id=3D"29f313656ab3"><strong>Finance</strong> owns:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f390b073-8e18-49cf-815a-15953b2b00a3">
<li local-id=3D"b5f507a5-f338-4fe4-b61a-3dce60df041a">
<p local-id=3D"7250672d8f32">revenue category/account mapping rules</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"e7f4e50a-9027-4952-84a1-92c8295c21d5">
<p local-id=3D"aa652d40a595">taxability and invoicing rules (as they apply =
to finance)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fe176aad-abf7-4bd5-b0d9-c086bcec5425">
<p local-id=3D"e60073a48cb7">Workday accounting configuration</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"85fe968f-e735-48f7-8216-bba8959fcbc6">
<p local-id=3D"6ada18d7fa89"><strong>BSI / Integration</strong> owns:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"15f5af71-d5f1-4e06-9c2c-230ac50d4519">
<li local-id=3D"a6fb7d9d-0d54-4835-9e04-de994cf90fe8">
<p local-id=3D"e9516f8064a5">integration pipelines</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1b1ae249-d762-4c81-a720-51cbbc27c6d2">
<p local-id=3D"7c2c1f2db30f">monitoring, error handling, and retry logic</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"c73eac9d-1475-45d7-b2a9-8409f866298a">
<p local-id=3D"d11984260723">data validation and reconciliation reporting</=
p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"e738fb0e5bc7" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-EditingRules(hardguardrails)">Editing Rules (hard guardrails)<=
/h3>
<ul local-id=3D"82619c68-8618-4737-9627-d702aa1bacc7">
<li local-id=3D"9b7b428f-6290-46cf-b8ca-a2da3ac217a2">
<p local-id=3D"2918b7ca56b5"><strong>SKUs and Prices are created/updated on=
ly in Salesforce</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3df12b7a-b9d9-4c32-96a1-adfe5bd9af5d">
<p local-id=3D"7e9f66a70ac7"><strong>Workday SKUs are not created manually<=
/strong> (unless explicitly approved as an exception process)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b4853e8-8258-4be1-8c09-25526e50c1d0">
<p local-id=3D"4db5b060d7a0">Workday may store <strong>finance-specific map=
ping fields</strong> (if required), but those must be governed and synchron=
ized back only if explicitly designed (default approach is to manage these =
mappings in Salesforce)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"4bda8dce-c640-4b20-bff2-d4cbff4e768e">
<h2 local-id=3D"6ad5a0acdd03" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-6)CanonicalSKUModel:WhatLivesWhere">6) Canonical SKU Model: Wh=
at Lives Where</h2>
<p local-id=3D"848f8035b705">This section defines what SKU-level data is au=
thoritative in Salesforce vs. what is stored in Workday.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"0cf6fe23cef2" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-6.1SalesforceSKU-LevelData(SourceofTruth)">6.1 Salesforce SKU-=
Level Data (Source of Truth)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"afebd96143fe">Salesforce will store and govern:</p>
<p local-id=3D"39f0b4349549"><strong>Identity &amp; Commercial Definition</=
strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"972a49a7-3721-4f5e-a60b-62e0b68070ea">
<li local-id=3D"fc1ad8bf-b96c-4da6-b769-936fba3b0d2c">
<p local-id=3D"5645b0ea2bc4">SKU Code (immutable unique identifier)</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"19fae73d-8bd5-4ef2-a0e7-a19e82b9ebe6">
<p local-id=3D"6a8627a4d3bd">SKU Name / Display Name</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bf4e1470-ccbc-40f0-b08c-2658c8ed792d">
<p local-id=3D"e4c6dac0e457">SKU Type (One-time, Recurring, Usage, Fee, Cre=
dit)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"df611c9e-3d0c-4f8d-95a8-51a7724fdda0">
<p local-id=3D"85e9a941a4ff">Product Family / Category (commercial taxonomy=
)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b3c6f05c-7aa9-4224-b9b3-732dd5e5608e">
<p local-id=3D"5c3ddf4d2962">Unit of Measure (UOM)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"00d3244e-23d0-4968-9f8d-9f067e917552">
<p local-id=3D"841499175d3d">Active/Inactive lifecycle status</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"45e34ae5-e03a-4cb1-b0fc-e704f306e32f">
<p local-id=3D"284bb7245a43">Effective dates for versions (if applicable)</=
p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d45ca25a38dc"><strong>Commercial Pricing</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ade0d603-3fe4-434a-9cc8-373cb5159821">
<li local-id=3D"cc2001b0-74b8-4252-bb45-b820c5289fbc">
<p local-id=3D"c21b3fad32ad">Official Price Lists (Price Books)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b7fc1ef-369b-44fe-884a-d762a71c5c50">
<p local-id=3D"9b4faf7128b0">Price list entries:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fdc8d948-77c5-4b2f-849f-1b78f7760b6f">
<li local-id=3D"f5492485-3bcb-4ab7-89dd-a9e42bc690ce">
<p local-id=3D"f8c7418ce3c9">list price</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3534775f-ebd4-4276-83a7-505a464218f3">
<p local-id=3D"3b6bc956f927">currency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"82f97208-249e-454b-bd90-6a4442f9fc6e">
<p local-id=3D"637130bf9887">billing frequency (monthly/annual, etc.)</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"a8888a09-25f3-446b-a8ee-b88f7841a7da">
<p local-id=3D"eb60f4a24a2b">charge type (one-time/recurring/usage)</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"775e41db-f10f-48f3-a11e-8849d50ca4c2">
<p local-id=3D"ca0ce9c0abe4">effective start/end dates</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ce84d91ff4aa"><strong>Commercial Packaging &amp; Selling Rul=
es</strong> <em>(Salesforce only)</em></p>
<ul local-id=3D"202a82ff-722c-4f5a-9db3-2a2aee7ef75a">
<li local-id=3D"42136731-5d68-49ff-bc42-69810dab64b9">
<p local-id=3D"9ba2cd72b112">Bundles and package structure</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cb9eea15-c525-42d0-b3a8-82be5c4465e8">
<p local-id=3D"76ee7359618c">Configuration attributes (if used)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eea78e6e-1f9e-4cce-9302-c2c171bec5ff">
<p local-id=3D"458af804b3e9">Eligibility/constraints</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c32e7ce8-93e2-4aac-b4a3-1a57e9e9a5d0">
<p local-id=3D"c34f87b57736">Discounting rules or pricing logic (as configu=
red in RCA)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"3376efc7630a"><strong>Exportability Requirement</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"89ac8c35-8434-4cac-93f5-d3274fbee573">
<li local-id=3D"62a3caad-d9db-47a1-a8e2-d2475d8a1362">
<p local-id=3D"45095533a72c">Salesforce will be able to produce:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"4eae5129-c0d5-476d-8613-0ba40b76af91">
<li local-id=3D"3c59db57-55c3-4aa4-ac6e-71ebe637af2f">
<p local-id=3D"f80130f6f69a">=E2=80=9COfficial Published Price List Export=
=E2=80=9D</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f18bad7-d8ce-4b17-b4a1-b3d73f512513">
<p local-id=3D"4ea24d51f46c">=E2=80=9CCurrent Active SKU Catalog Export=E2=
=80=9D</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"394feaf7-9a51-4236-8333-b7c4e4efcaed">
<p local-id=3D"cc6abae946eb">=E2=80=9CSKU Change Log=E2=80=9D</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"d1a7648e-03f2-45a6-af28-0c7ad1eb9f55">
<h3 local-id=3D"bdc144d12e08" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-6.2WorkdaySKU-LevelData(DownstreamMirror/FinancialUse)">6.2 Wo=
rkday SKU-Level Data (Downstream Mirror / Financial Use)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"ba680a1e0fc5">Workday will store a synchronized subset requi=
red to:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"9a5c26eb-6cbc-4185-9b3d-61158ebc80ab">
<li local-id=3D"73732ad0-6f97-40a1-935b-bad130166001">
<p local-id=3D"9d40a84a5549">recognize items in contracts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"56e142b2-3039-4d0a-82f2-c4cf3c2d815f">
<p local-id=3D"98e15f245f29">generate invoices</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60901304-3e0a-4b88-9c48-7e76b3dc6853">
<p local-id=3D"e31957fdc055">support downstream accounting and reporting</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7e75e540877c">Workday stores:</p>
<p local-id=3D"e57a7f4e16f3"><strong>SKU Reference Fields (mirrored)</stron=
g></p>
<ul local-id=3D"15a834aa-d954-4a78-8450-a216a62d22bd">
<li local-id=3D"f7e5b3ee-ae50-40c6-a872-9f67ae4efeab">
<p local-id=3D"8d70e4d031ea">SKU Code (from Salesforce; used as cross-syste=
m identifier)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ded77fc-f558-4978-b782-1583728810a4">
<p local-id=3D"109171d3b1ec">SKU Name (for readability)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b881eb2c-7a9b-4dfa-a469-b0aed9593b2b">
<p local-id=3D"d59a0173d337">SKU Status (active/inactive)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b68075a3-0c7f-402b-af40-d746d6e7fe5a">
<p local-id=3D"c315f299f805">Charge type / billing behavior (as needed for =
invoice rules)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"01b6f105f781"><strong>Finance &amp; Billing Classification</=
strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b11c73e0-fe6a-4106-bce9-0488c58b090e">
<li local-id=3D"90822d74-5857-4b69-8d19-791e4f689af9">
<p local-id=3D"fda10f11b357">Revenue category / revenue recognition classif=
ication (if applicable)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0f6471d5-a93d-4453-bcfa-811f738b719f">
<p local-id=3D"cc8037c7835b">Tax code or taxability indicator (if applicabl=
e)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c1782265-0755-4d87-9fc3-959db8d31108">
<p local-id=3D"d6f4a19e7143">Billing category / invoice grouping</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1d18c916-43a0-4d85-95ec-3fccf17cbfb1">
<p local-id=3D"892037a5f286">GL mapping (as required by Finance policy)</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote local-id=3D"8f13271d-a43c-4fd2-91c7-3091ee75a586">
<p local-id=3D"5370449ffa11">Note: Workday should not =E2=80=9Crecompute=E2=
=80=9D list prices. It should invoice from the <strong>Salesforce order lin=
e amounts</strong> provided at order submission and amendment events.</p>
</blockquote>
<hr local-id=3D"d147b3b4-6cae-42c4-9549-86460f44853d">
<h1 local-id=3D"7b9fc40176bf" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-TobeImplementedbyBSI"><span data-colorid=3D"gr123kks5z">To be =
Implemented by BSI </span></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"5c756f2b2473" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-7)IntegrationApproach(SyncStrategy)"><span data-colorid=3D"rjh=
qp4axs6">7) Integration Approach (Sync Strategy)</span></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"b1f28f014743" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-7.1MasterDataSync(SKU+PriceLists)"><span data-colorid=3D"sy2ef=
z4lx7">7.1 Master Data Sync (SKU + Price Lists)</span></h3>
<p local-id=3D"2fb63ca86ee1"><strong><span data-colorid=3D"ihkadmszqs">Dire=
ction:</span></strong><span data-colorid=3D"pg8e1a8fba"> Salesforce =E2=86=
=92 Mulesoft =E2=86=92 Workday</span><br><strong><span data-colorid=3D"c30o=
jlj2h6">Frequency:</span></strong><span data-colorid=3D"zkjoyrw30w"> Schedu=
led + Event-driven (recommended)</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"caaf593d-23df-43bf-9d68-4f8c8118cb44">
<li local-id=3D"412a84e5-acfd-4e33-948f-5bca5ccdf67a">
<p local-id=3D"5aacf9c7ce74"><span data-colorid=3D"zs8sfzlung">Event-driven=
 for =E2=80=9CPublish=E2=80=9D actions (new or changed SKUs/prices)</span><=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2aa2810f-fc39-485f-a8ea-8c215418048b">
<p local-id=3D"fd803ce56ce6"><span data-colorid=3D"oveqz50z4a">Scheduled re=
conciliation job (daily) to catch drift</span></p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f0e36cc63ffc"><strong><span data-colorid=3D"q0vydn4ewi">What=
 triggers a push?</span></strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a8f3df18-d320-4105-8234-35ca7674813c">
<li local-id=3D"2acdc926-3aa0-4f12-a2f4-802bc02468ce">
<p local-id=3D"cfba09131687"><span data-colorid=3D"tyheu74mpp">SKU created =
or status changed to Active/Retired</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e8a2ce87-5c44-4e4c-ab85-c0ff2a10c77e">
<p local-id=3D"5f33f216c650"><span data-colorid=3D"z164gc2ok3">Price list c=
hanged and set to </span><strong><span data-colorid=3D"i0kz3cmm5k">Approved=
/Published</span></strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"598764ee-8fa3-413e-b932-1870b53f78d9">
<p local-id=3D"77847f6fa35e"><span data-colorid=3D"r56p46w4i0">Effective-da=
ted price entry created/updated</span></p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"31519281a435" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-7.2TransactionSync(Orders=E2=86=92WorkdayContract)">7.2 Transa=
ction Sync (Orders =E2=86=92 Workday Contract)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"dcca7a890f97"><strong>Direction:</strong> Salesforce Order =
=E2=86=92 Mulesoft =E2=86=92 Workday Contract<br><strong>What is sent:</str=
ong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c20233d8-b649-422e-adbe-f9ab965b1a34">
<li local-id=3D"c801af7f-4066-42ee-b8de-516eb32a8819">
<p local-id=3D"f341af1bd9c4">Customer/account reference</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dcaff143-8d8e-4860-b956-c0e4337a4a6b">
<p local-id=3D"8480df1e51e6">Order lines (SKU code, quantity, price, dates,=
 billing terms, tax flags)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc0d7c4f-3a14-4166-ae69-ec9b6d841621">
<p local-id=3D"caa0a4e62a36">Contract term and billing schedule as required=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a968dd9-2730-400a-8287-3cc30a95bf75">
<p local-id=3D"792765b667e9">Amendment events for changes after initial ord=
er</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0259e2f652b1" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-7.3ErrorHandling&amp;Reconciliation"><span data-colorid=3D"cut=
wq4e4m1">7.3 Error Handling &amp; Reconciliation</span></h3>
<p local-id=3D"c6927d980741"><span data-colorid=3D"qqf7o5tfcb">BSI Integrat=
ion will support:</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"ae96540b-206d-483e-a512-5e1c85aa0ff0">
<li local-id=3D"72fc2e46-8c5e-4112-8d3a-6b3b71980c73">
<p local-id=3D"a0b99922c685"><span data-colorid=3D"q0cf5a5qie">Retry logic =
for transient errors</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3aa205f8-b021-466d-9083-51770c035afb">
<p local-id=3D"3d4c9b8a990a"><span data-colorid=3D"e84udi183r">Dead-letter =
queue/error mailbox for exceptions</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fd9ceead-7f6f-43e1-9724-5a36f742b166">
<p local-id=3D"0e9e4d48f994"><span data-colorid=3D"kmeci590pt">Daily reconc=
iliation report:</span></p>
<ul local-id=3D"a5c20838-d7c3-4683-ad56-a022be0738f9">
<li local-id=3D"0f1326d0-0576-48a9-ba35-b838ca63fdb2">
<p local-id=3D"64f7203d86a0"><span data-colorid=3D"xlgis203zq">SKUs missing=
 in Workday</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9297e7f3-9d08-40f4-9cef-a9dde4d3905c">
<p local-id=3D"786671b47b2a"><span data-colorid=3D"sfdmj8icro">status misma=
tches</span></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c316736-6410-4eda-a4ca-a146cd57ab25">
<p local-id=3D"7157c09ba499"><span data-colorid=3D"iw38osopgs">pricing effe=
ctive date conflicts (if mirrored)</span></p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"d6ebd506-1372-4935-b553-1cbd90d3a56c">
<h2 local-id=3D"91adaff3a38b" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-8)OfficialPriceListExportProcess(RequiredCapability)">8) Offic=
ial Price List Export Process (Required Capability)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"def4b93f47ec" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Goal">Goal</h3>
<p local-id=3D"5dcee9f509e4">Any authorized team can export the <strong>off=
icial price list</strong> at any time.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"e6e99ed77af9" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Definitionof=E2=80=9COfficial=E2=80=9D">Definition of =E2=80=
=9COfficial=E2=80=9D</h3>
<p local-id=3D"c122489e8f12">A price list is =E2=80=9Cofficial=E2=80=9D whe=
n it is:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"f0e13e66-f078-4e86-a9e8-09f185c5b07b">
<li local-id=3D"8fddfa43-c4ee-4fe2-b65c-60bd0a2af7b2">
<p local-id=3D"8e98cd3aab43">in <strong>Approved/Published</strong> status<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f19c9f05-c501-4f5d-ab05-2f7fff5fe2cd">
<p local-id=3D"0454d448db34">effective dated</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4859ea41-b0f2-4720-8d29-c49d8eea077d">
<p local-id=3D"6a5a429dcb25">controlled via change management/approvals</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"00deb27970af" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-ExportFormat(recommended)">Export Format (recommended)</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"00284cb7-c177-4cfe-9ff1-f22f658e3c96">
<li local-id=3D"371cb8cf-9606-4c07-9895-20c642ea98b7">
