<li local-id=3D"1c6d98c3-60fc-4bf8-8bfc-f88861bacd9e">
<p local-id=3D"2161da6de128">Price List Name</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"947c0f69-5267-4ad2-99fa-0bf921753801">
<p local-id=3D"f41cf7868ee3">Currency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e898c7e5-92c5-4b61-b724-d3efee832cdf">
<p local-id=3D"b834a0592298">Market/Segment (if applicable)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e2fdc78-89d3-47d8-b86b-6d4e05e3f47c">
<p local-id=3D"2d1f29ad535d">SKU Code</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aaeba4ae-877e-43ca-9c66-7ae03367c3f7">
<p local-id=3D"6e2259bc5ecd">SKU Name</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c14a8a5-e2bb-4ed7-8651-63d180c2d328">
<p local-id=3D"1655bfcbbcad">Charge Type</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7aedf468-fa0c-4531-abbf-3405982710c5">
<p local-id=3D"b3d37a360d13">Billing Frequency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"095f09e8-fb0d-402d-a55e-f6e6a13c712c">
<p local-id=3D"fa831fc7d5ec">UOM</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"99cf8170-23b5-4885-8fa8-7066c78ad8bd">
<p local-id=3D"c55010b7e228">Unit Price</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b92a05a-0f1a-415e-a3f3-291fe51a2748">
<p local-id=3D"ae7bda159171">Effective Start Date</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb88115b-f5b0-42d6-8fc9-66198e506c22">
<p local-id=3D"d3185dbf6460">Effective End Date</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4662e6c7-4da8-4654-b16c-4f95203736d0">
<p local-id=3D"c9f7ec33c91b">Published Version / Timestamp</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"8704c727-5813-455a-a9d5-ce1849d28c81">
<h2 local-id=3D"5f67641cbc8c" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-9)Governance&amp;ChangeManagement">9) Governance &amp; Change =
Management</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"c7ce3cb8ec64" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Requiredcontrols">Required controls</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"a971d574-adc5-49fe-816a-7ae53c0b0ad7">
<li local-id=3D"99c7ce0b-6606-4556-87c9-fcacdb952e53">
<p local-id=3D"ac4347b31d72"><strong>SKU Code Convention &amp; Uniqueness</=
strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f71ac045-fa8b-4df2-a782-5c60b53c813b">
<p local-id=3D"c085a5b5ea51"><strong>Approval workflow</strong> for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"26057e05-53b8-4a6d-a852-af95962d4d94">
<li local-id=3D"3aff08b3-79a8-4772-96ca-7cb4ec9ea821">
<p local-id=3D"eb673f42efd9">creating new SKUs (optional)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4fc46cce-a8f3-419b-9932-0a02c1ad5cbc">
<p local-id=3D"2c86c4da0b5e">retiring SKUs</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a3e26d21-5749-4838-a522-61c69d2657aa">
<p local-id=3D"c41398876ed4">publishing price lists</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"5896ea41-dfa5-405e-a76f-e4bdd3ecd2bb">
<p local-id=3D"65dffb6c6153"><strong>Effective dating enforced</strong></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"e70ecc50-2bcb-4f25-bca1-4bf73b37367c">
<p local-id=3D"a981f6df6a11"><strong>No overlapping effective dates</strong=
> for the same SKU + price list + charge type + billing frequency</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"121b04c0-f45d-4862-a8b5-b19bd78063c2">
<p local-id=3D"d9692beafeea"><strong>Audit logging</strong> for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"fa82bdc6-4cbc-404c-bb60-3d259c317f24">
<li local-id=3D"21147515-ebec-4798-bb89-4fe221e78426">
<p local-id=3D"437f838c84ef">who changed what</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b0d23dde-cdbe-4607-9ada-5da2127cc216">
<p local-id=3D"bf16eab276af">when changes were approved/published</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"d9698cec99bc" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Changetypesandexpectations">Change types and expectations</h3>
<p local-id=3D"0e2f7567b287"><strong>Minor (non-pricing) changes</strong></=
p>
<ul local-id=3D"35606295-ecb5-40c4-84e6-4b2788b725cf">
<li local-id=3D"bfd5e921-4153-46e8-879e-2bf9245b4b11">
<p local-id=3D"57deaae0f5e5">Description changes, naming changes</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28dfe444-dca8-4fe0-ab32-85f8802f3a86">
<p local-id=3D"c3c12f32697e">Effective date optional depending on policy</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"e80d62eb-903a-4d64-b6b5-e33a5f8cb21b">
<p local-id=3D"6a717b5d3267">Sync to Workday for readability</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d23135bb09f3"><strong>Pricing changes</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"3c85161c-5208-4a93-99fc-3404548071a8">
<li local-id=3D"5176cb34-184f-40e1-8ed8-6556ea2e26f4">
<p local-id=3D"7951b4cb3460">Always effective-dated</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a30ccc7d-8dd5-4f71-84d4-e0febafb1fb8">
<p local-id=3D"ce284dd32b70">Always requires approval + publish event</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"b93a24ee-9da5-4685-b8f2-29dfdb58e437">
<p local-id=3D"6b6c022a9f3f">Always triggers Workday mirror update (if mirr=
ored)</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"55779e4f7e7d"><strong>SKU retirement</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b38ab778-cc91-4689-95d1-ca27d7956ca2">
<li local-id=3D"55825988-8c61-4bcf-b8c6-8d047afdcf06">
<p local-id=3D"7a71cce77760">Retire in Salesforce</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e2e91c2c-a34e-40c8-a625-efba096d299b">
<p local-id=3D"a0ed86fcf860">Sync to Workday</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2ef43251-f4eb-4cd4-b0ed-5aac84002522">
<p local-id=3D"44d897ab7212">Prevent quoting new deals; existing contracts =
unaffected</p></li>
</ul>
