<hr local-id=3D"c74aca8e-9752-4f22-b4cc-55890cddf331">
<h2 local-id=3D"f99593d8c439" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-11)FAQs/Clarifications">11) FAQs / Clarifications</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"3519c29dec61" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Q1:CanWorkdayhavepricestoo?">Q1: Can Workday have prices too?<=
/h3>
<p local-id=3D"3e14ea45a059">Workday may store <strong>reference prices</st=
rong>, but the invoice should be based on <strong>order line pricing from S=
alesforce</strong> to avoid drift and disagreements. If Workday requires pr=
icing for certain invoice validation, we will sync only <strong>published</=
strong> prices and effective dates.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"2912e9800715" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Q2:WhocanchangeSKUs?">Q2: Who can change SKUs?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"680c580687c8">Only approved roles in Salesforce (RevOps/Prod=
uct Ops). Workday is not an authoring system for SKUs.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"552cbe63e844" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Q3:Whataboutdiscounts?">Q3: What about discounts?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"3ca41061e6fc">Discounting logic and commercial rules remain =
in Salesforce. Workday receives the <strong>final agreed price</strong> on =
the order lines.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"6ec914bd1e83" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-Q4:WhatifFinanceneedsnewrevenuemapping?">Q4: What if Finance n=
eeds new revenue mapping?</h3>
<p local-id=3D"56b34efaee10">Finance can request updates to the SKU=E2=80=
=99s financial mapping fields in Salesforce (preferred), or in Workday if r=
equired by policy=E2=80=94but the goal is to keep the mapping authoritative=
 and governed in one place.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"97e301f9-93f0-4584-98b7-4d4a3dc269fa">
<h2 local-id=3D"4ab994778f7c" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-12)NextSteps/ImplementationPlan(HighLevel)">12) Next Steps / I=
mplementation Plan (High Level)</h2>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"3a1d6cb7-9e43-4d17-ad56-06accf76570f">
<li local-id=3D"ab74aec3-4f2c-4851-9ab0-53caa98154e8">
<p local-id=3D"be36ca1ae763">Finalize the canonical SKU field list (Salesfo=
rce master + Workday mirror)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d6e7dcc7-78ef-447b-84a2-ba9f2f0e68cb">
<p local-id=3D"db5b5374990c">Define SKU code conventions and lifecycle stat=
es</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b1ac90b7-2747-40d6-b45f-6d87ee040ded">
<p local-id=3D"a496e374c512">Build Salesforce approval workflow for:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"eb00f231-1928-46ef-b6c2-34502872b685">
<li local-id=3D"4c3b24ed-e0e9-43d9-b621-ed3a8e6d6d07">
<p local-id=3D"c3a0f5527f97">SKU retirement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d293d37c-eb39-4345-957b-64ad0f23b35a">
<p local-id=3D"58bb41e0707a">Price list publish</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"fcb0d474-a612-46a4-a605-dd41fa52f593">
<p local-id=3D"b30598b77217">Implement iPaaS flows:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"24a12626-a829-48ff-ac1a-0fa8bd9690e4">
<li local-id=3D"d1e76bf4-eda1-4f3f-b557-302ea9402c74">
<p local-id=3D"f3e54e4edb4c">SKU publish =E2=86=92 Workday</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6fcd27de-c4b0-4dc5-93bf-91fc824fc2ab">
<p local-id=3D"2def2bfd89c6">Price list publish =E2=86=92 Workday (optional=
/reference)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7261a50f-1205-4976-85bc-ba4de28ff160">
<p local-id=3D"801d99d32fbf">Order submit =E2=86=92 Workday contract creati=
on</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"429933cc-2367-422b-a2d8-42b3594fdd85">
<p local-id=3D"5c6176360c48">Establish reconciliation reports + dashboards<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ce1ffe2f-9d59-43ee-bb49-43897dee6336">
<p local-id=3D"ee6de1b348fb">Train teams on ownership and change process</p=
></li>
</ol>
<hr local-id=3D"d1f47704-28c8-4afb-a425-00117e35b81e">
<h1 local-id=3D"18ae5fbeb6de" id=3D"FortraSkuDatabaseManagement(Salesforce&=
amp;Workday)-AppendixA:Recommended=E2=80=9CMinimalRequiredFields=E2=80=9Dto=
MirrorintoWorkday">Appendix A: Recommended =E2=80=9CMinimal Required Fields=
=E2=80=9D to Mirror into Workday</h1>
<p local-id=3D"1ebced6500f3"><strong>Required</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"208106e6-523c-4323-bcb4-b85254634dc0">
